	(gr_text_box "NOTES\n\n1. FABRICATE PER IPC-6012 CLASS 2. ACCEPTABILITY PER IPC-A-600 CLASS 2 (CURRENT REVISION).\n2. 2 COPPER LAYERS. FR4, Tg >= 150 C, UL 94V-0. FINISHED THICKNESS 1.6 mm +/-10%.\n3. COPPER: 1 oz (35 um) FINISHED, BOTH LAYERS.\n4. SURFACE FINISH: ENIG.\n5. SOLDER MASK: GREEN LPI, BOTH SIDES. VIAS TENTED BOTH SIDES.\n6. SILKSCREEN: WHITE, BOTH SIDES.\n7. HOLE SIZES ARE FINISHED SIZES.\n8. 100% ELECTRICAL TEST TO IPC-D-356 NETLIST.\n9. RoHS COMPLIANT.\n10. FAB DATE CODE / UL MARK PERMITTED ON BOTTOM SIDE, CLEAR OF HV WARNING TEXT."
